# Welcome to {{team.name}}

Requests for {{team.name}} arrive in the **{{team.queue}}** queue. When
something is on fire, page {{team.onCall}}.

## Your first week

| Day | Do this |
| --- | --- |
| 1 | Get repository access and run the service locally. |
| 2 | Shadow a queue rotation in {{team.queue}}. |
| 3 | Ship a small change through the release pipeline. |

